      "widgets_values": [
        "One continuous fixed-camera anime shot. The surprised girl walks directly toward the camera from the sunny road into the shaded alley. Her torso turns to face the camera as she starts walking, with a natural alternating gait, forward weight transfer and gentle opposing arm swing. She crosses the entrance and approaches close to the lens, growing larger through real forward movement. Her head stays at normal standing height, spine upright, eyes looking ahead toward the camera, lips slightly parted in curious surprise. Her hair trails and softly sways with her steps; the skirt and tie follow her movement subtly. Cool shade gradually covers her as daylight stays behind her. She reaches the close frontal walking pose of the final image. Camera position, angle and focal length stay fixed; houses, pipes and walls remain stationary. Crisp consistent anime features and linework."
